  "description": {
   "en": "Proposed to my lifelong nemesis? A dangerous romance of chasing and deceiving between a scheming woman and a prickly man, based on Yuna Jin's original work.  \nElise, the Empire's most wanted criminal, dreams of a new life after leaving her dark past behind, only to receive a terminal diagnosis.  \nThe only solution is to obtain the \"Stone of Time,\" owned by Duke Johannes—the man who's been chasing her all her life.  \nScrew it. Can't she just hide her identity?  \n\"Love at first sight, Duke! Marry me!\"  \nCan Elise successfully hide her identity and secure the Stone of Time?"
  },
